<DocsLayout
  title="Sterium"
  description="Explore correspondences, generate and save spells, track lunar and planetary timing, and build a living digital grimoire with Sterium."
>
  <main class="sterium-page">
    <section class="hero">
      <div class="hero-copy reveal">
        <p class="eyebrow">Meet Sterium</p>

        <h1>Keep your magical practice connected, searchable, and alive in one place.</h1>

        <p class="hero-text">
          Sterium is a personal magical practice companion built around the tools,
          records, and timing that shape your path. Explore correspondences,
          generate and save spells, follow the moon and planetary hours, keep a
          detailed grimoire, and bring your daily practice into one connected
          space instead of scattering it across notes and separate references.
        </p>

        <div class="hero-actions" aria-label="Sterium links">
          <a class="primary-button raised-button" href="#features">
            Explore Features
          </a>

          <a class="secondary-button raised-button" href="/contact">
            Contact Support
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="hero-showcase reveal reveal-delay">
        <div class="showcase-card main-card">
          <span class="mini-label">Your Practice in Sterium</span>

          <h4>Everything magical, gathered together.</h4>

          <div class="progress-line">
            <span></span>
          </div>

          <div class="showcase-stats">
            <span><b>Moon</b> timing</span>
            <span><b>Spells</b> saved</span>
            <span><b>Grimoire</b> growing</span>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="floating-card floating-card-one">
          <span>Planetary Hour</span>
          <strong>Your current timing is ready</strong>
        </div>

        <div class="floating-card floating-card-two">
          <span>Current Moon</span>
          <strong>Phase and zodiac in view</strong>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <GradientDivider />

    <section class="intro-section reveal">
      <p class="eyebrow">One Connected Practice</p>

      <h2>Your correspondences, timing, spellwork, and records belong together.</h2>

      <p>
        Sterium brings daily spiritual timing, correspondence research, spell
        creation, saved spells, and a structured grimoire into one system. Instead
        of switching between disconnected references and notes, you can keep the
        pieces of your practice close enough to actually work together.
      </p>
